    {
      "source": "Supports a sequence of an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> parameter for the metadata value,\nfollowed by a <a href=\"../../../util/MimeType.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.util\"><code>MimeType</code></a> parameter for the metadata mime type.",
